Tabular Specification: Search Weather by City
Element	Description
Use Case Name	Search Weather by City
Actors	General User
Description	User enters a city name to retrieve current weather and forecast
Preconditions	Application is running; internet connection available
Postconditions	Weather data for the city is displayed; error shown if invalid
Main Flow	1. User enters city name in search field
2. User clicks Search button
3. System validates input (non-empty)
4. System sends request to weather API
5. System displays current weather conditions
6. System displays 5-day forecast
7. System displays any weather alerts
Alternative Flows	A1 - Invalid City:
1. System returns "Location not found" message
2. User is prompted to try again
Exceptions	E1 - API Timeout: System displays "Service temporarily unavailable, please try again"
E2 - No Internet: Browser displays connection error
Priority	High
Business Rules	City name must be at least 2 characters; API key must be valid
