Tabular Specification: Toggle Temperature Unit
Element	Description
Use Case Name	Toggle Temperature Unit
Actors	General User
Description	User switches temperature display between Celsius and Fahrenheit
Preconditions	Weather data is currently displayed on screen
Postconditions	All temperature values convert to the selected unit
Main Flow	1. User clicks the unit toggle button
2. System identifies current unit state
3. System converts all displayed temperatures using formula
4. System updates UI with new values
5. System highlights the active unit button
Alternative Flows	None
Exceptions	E1 - No Data Loaded: Unit toggle is disabled or does nothing
Priority	Medium
Business Rules	°C to °F: (°C × 9/5) + 32; °F to °C: (°F - 32) × 5/9; Toggle state persists during session
