Tabular Specification: View 5-Day Forecast
Element	Description
Use Case Name	View 5-Day Forecast
Actors	General User
Description	User views weather predictions for the next 5 days
Preconditions	User has successfully searched for a valid location
Postconditions	Forecast cards display daily weather summary
Main Flow	1. System retrieves forecast data from API
2. System extracts daily summaries (high/low temps, conditions)
3. System creates a card for each day
4. System displays cards in chronological order
5. User scrolls horizontally or vertically to view all days
Alternative Flows	A1 - Incomplete Data: System displays "Forecast data unavailable" message
Exceptions	E1 - API Limit Exceeded: System displays rate limit message
Priority	High
Business Rules	Forecast shows days 1-5 only; Each card shows day name, icon, high/low, description
